NuvioMobile (core)
==================
StreamBridge’s runnable core (Android and iOS) is official NuvioMobile,
imported from:

  https://github.com/NuvioMedia/NuvioMobile
  branch: cmp-rewrite
  commit: 1cfae0fe7402f5e6f1fedad393d50d83775586fa
  tag: 0.6.2-beta
  previous pins: 79b750f3 (0.6.1-beta), 5c6028f2 (0.5.5-beta),
                 bb3c1e4c (0.5.2-beta), b88fef2e (0.5.1),
                 ec441c7b (0.4.25-beta), d177eb57 (0.4.17)
  license: GNU General Public License v3.0

Copyright (c) NuvioMedia and NuvioMobile contributors.

Imported as-is into `composeApp/`, `androidApp/`, `iosApp/`, and
`gradle/` with StreamBridge identity overlays only (applicationId and
iOS bundle identifier, visible app name, launcher marks, updater
source). Kotlin packages remain `com.nuvio.app` / `com.nuvio.android`.

NuvioMobile-Enhanced (feature overlay)
======================================
Unique fork features (Live TV, OMDB episode ratings, hero trailer extras,
volume boost, HLS quality chooser, library calendar, profile insights,
download location / Wi-Fi-only, etc.) were overlaid from:

  https://github.com/luqmanfadlli/NuvioMobile-Enhanced
  branch: enhanced
  commit: 5d978096f9eb04a62a6bc3a5d6999bdccab4c9cb
  tag: 0.6.2-beta
  previous pins: 504014d3 (0.6.1-beta), 8b3bd867 (0.5.5-beta),
                 3da8d06f (0.5.2-beta), 9d311c18 (0.5.1-beta),
                 ce4492ec (0.4.23-beta)
  license: GNU General Public License v3.0

Official NuvioMobile 0.6.2-beta is contained in that tag; the Enhanced
overlay adds unique features on top. StreamBridge identity, empty default
addons, and updater source `sascio/MyBridge` are preserved.

Vendored binaries shipped by those pins (GPL application):

  composeApp/libs/lib-exoplayer-release.aar
  composeApp/libs/lib-decoder-ffmpeg-release.aar
  composeApp/libs/lib-decoder-av1-release.aar
  composeApp/libs/lib-decoder-mpegh-release.aar
  composeApp/libs/lib-ui-release.aar
  composeApp/libs/lib-nuvio-engine-android-0.1.2.aar
  composeApp/libs/quickjs-kt-android-1.0.5-nuvio.aar
  composeApp/libs/cloudstream-runtime-api-4.8.0-3496e5f.aar
                 (CloudStream 3 runtime API, GPL-3.0; sideload/full
                  distribution only, see docs/CLOUDSTREAM-AUDIT.md)

The iOS build additionally consumes upstream build-time dependencies
that are not committed to this repository: the pinned Nuvio Engine Apple
XCFramework (0.1.2) fetched by scripts/prepare-ios-dependencies.sh, and
the MPVKit local Swift package (LGPL-3.0) referenced as ../MPVKit.
Bundled subtitle fonts (Noto Sans / Noto Sans CJK, SIL Open Font
License) ship under iosApp/iosApp/SubtitleFonts/ with their license.

AIOStreams (optional subtitle renderer)
=======================================
The optional libmpv/libass renderer for ASS/SSA subtitles on Android ports
code from https://github.com/Viren070/AIOStreams (`packages/android/exoplayer`):

  androidApp/src/main/cpp/ass_surface.c, ass/ass.h, ass/ass_types.h,
  androidApp/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt
  composeApp/src/androidMain/kotlin/com/nuvio/app/features/player/aiostreams/

  license: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
  full text: third_party/AIOStreams/LICENSE
  provenance: third_party/AIOStreams/README.md
  copyright: AIOStreams contributors

AGPL-3.0 section 13 permits combining this code with a GPL-3.0 work; the
combined StreamBridge distribution is conveyed under GPL-3.0 and this
notice is retained. The libass headers in that folder are ISC-licensed.

